{"duration_api_ms":215705,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8b7477d6-4a35-4a91-bd75-6b71b789acc0","total_cost_usd":0.264306,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15568,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":20203,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":15045},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15568,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":20203,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15568},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":20203,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15568,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.264306,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":15045,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"Progress has stalled: normalised hypervolume went 0.3161 to 0.3469 to 0.3540 to 0.3550 over rounds 1-4. All 25 front points are one curve along flight_path_angle at the corner D~3.38, B=1.2, cone 69.5-70. Peak g caps the steepness at about -3.57 deg. The mass-fraction margin caps D at about 3.385 (margin 0.0007 at D=3.384). Bluntness above 1.2 fails with the aero-surface extrapolation error, and cone 66 at B=1.2 gives an invalid geometry. Every off-corner design I have is dominated: C-c2876c011ef7 (B=1.1), C-df6184e17083 (B=0.88), and the small-D or low-B rows.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-f71f4a44911d (D 3.384, cone 70, gamma -3.565): g margin 0.00078, mass margin 0.00074, flux 274.6k, T 391.15 K. This is the corner, pinned by g and mass.\",\"C-2b5fe1686946 and C-06ef682a7ce9 (gamma -1.5 and -1.7): flux 227.7k and 231.7k, T 418.0 and 414.7 K. The front is a smooth curve in gamma, about 10 K/deg and 24k W/m2 per deg, with gaps of 2-3 K between neighbours.\",\"Mass-fraction margin is 0.0029 at D=3.38 and 0.00074 at D=3.384. That is a slope of about -0.55 to -0.6 per m, so the margin reaches zero near D=3.385. Cone changes it negligibly (C-e2aaf4242e38 at cone 69.8: 0.0030).\",\"C-c2876c011ef7 (B 1.1, D 3.36) and C-df6184e17083 (B 0.88, D 3.3) at gamma -3.5 have flux 280.7k and 302.6k and T 392.9 and 395.7 K, both worse than C-e2aaf4242e38 (273.5k, 391.9 K). Lower B and lower D are dominated.\",\"Extrapolation failures at B 1.205, 1.21, 1.22 and 1.25 (C-05beb8f06d5f, C-3d41ce848a30, C-68332aab55f2, C-5b57439845df). B=1.2 is the effective ceiling of the aero surrogate.\",\"Large-D or steep-gamma designs (C-4cf8bee56534, C-f84c59a3cc23) violate g or mass and gain little T. g rises about 1.7 per deg of steepness.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak g is set almost entirely by entry angle (about 1.7 per deg of steepness). Bondline T falls about 10 K/deg as the entry steepens, so g caps T near 391 K. Mass fraction caps D near 3.385. Larger D, higher B and larger cone lower flux and T, but all three are at their ceilings (B by the surrogate hull, cone by the variable bound). The remaining lever is the position along gamma. Given the corner is saturated, the reliable gain is to densify the front, since hypervolume is a staircase and each intermediate point adds a small area. I do this at the proven mass-safe D=3.384. Two points at D=3.385 probe the last sliver of D and gamma next to the g and mass limits. This relies on local interpolation of the existing series, plus the roughly linear g(gamma) trend.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Each expected gain is small, at most about 1e-5 in normalised hypervolume. The D=3.385 points depend on my estimate of the mass-margin slope; the margin should be about +0.0001 to +0.0002, but could be slightly negative. The -3.567 point sits within about 0.005 of the g limit. I have not found a way past the g and mass corners; a different region would need new information, such as a larger B-cone surrogate hull. Flux and T predictions are interpolations and should be accurate to about 1k W/m2 and 0.3 K.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Low-flux end of the front at the mass-safe corner D=3.384, cone 70. It should slightly dominate C-2b5fe1686946.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Extends and slightly improves the shallow end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the 3.3 K T gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between C-2b5fe1686946 and C-06ef682a7ce9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between C-06ef682a7ce9 (-1.7) and -1.6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.65},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":230700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate point between gamma -1.7 and -1.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.75},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":232500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":413.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Intermediate point between C-5bc54b8cbb1b (-1.8) and C-6a031c8b7ef2 (-2.0).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -2.0 and -2.1 and the following points.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the 2.9 K gap between -2.1 and -2.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":242100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -2.3 and -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Corner geometry (D 3.384, cone 70) at gamma -2.5. It slightly dominates C-3ddb7b7beb56, which used cone 69.5 and D 3.38.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Replaces a slightly weaker point on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -2.5 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between C-4dc37a3f4f3a (-2.7) and -2.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Corner geometry at gamma -2.9. It slightly dominates C-33eaf5914682.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Replaces a slightly weaker point on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -2.9 and -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":261200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between C-9ac42b14804e (-3.1) and C-e9fb95df2518 (-3.3).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Corner geometry at gamma -3.35. It slightly dominates C-a1b3308822b3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Replaces a slightly weaker point on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -3.35 and -3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":270600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between C-4682430c8b55 (-3.45) and -3.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.48},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Uses D=3.385, the tiny extra D allowed by the mass cap (estimated margin about +0.0002), at gamma -3.5. This tests the last sliver of D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks whether the mass-margin slope estimate holds at D=3.385, and whether a still-larger D is worth chasing. It would improve on C-e2aaf4242e38.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -3.5 and -3.565, with an estimated g of about 11.965.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Staircase densification near the corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f71f4a44911d\",\"rationale\":\"The extreme corner: D=3.385 and gamma -3.567. Estimated g is 11.995 against the limit of 12, mass margin about 0.0001-0.0002. It should be the lowest-T feasible point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.567},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Pushes the g and mass limits together to the lowest T available, and calibrates the g and mass margins at the corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1}]}","ttft_ms":174628,"type":"result","duration_ms":215967,"uuid":"1a655f17-8970-4797-9658-bbb83160bd54","ttft_stream_ms":1693,"time_to_request_ms":263,"first_content_frame_ms":1693,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
